// Values that belong to the whole pack rather than a character. Written as
// <owner>.<name>: woods.fox_meetings.
== values woods
values:
    fox_meetings: number
    last_rest: time

// Text snippets: reusable text, inserted with [weather]. They can use
// conditions and variations.
== text weather
[if time is night]The night is cold and clear.[else][one of]A light breeze stirs the pines.[or]The air smells of resin and rain.[or]It's a warm, still day.[at random][end if]

// A plain scene other content can play ("play woods.night_sounds") or go to
// ("-> woods.night_sounds"). "---" is a page break: the player clicks to go on.
// "play <scene> 2 to 3 times" repeats a scene.
== scene woods.night_sounds
You lie awake listening to the woods.
---
play woods.owl 2 to 3 times
Eventually, sleep comes.

== scene woods.owl
[one of]An owl calls.[or]Another owl answers.[or]Something small scurries over the roof.[at random]
